<h1>Your Visitly workspace invitation</h1>
<p>You’re invited to <%= @business_name %> as <%= @role %>.</p>
<p>This link expires in seven days. Register and verify the invited email if needed, then return to this link to accept. Do not create a separate workspace.</p>
<p><%= link_to "View invitation", @url, style: "display:inline-block;background:#226e54;color:white;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:8px" %></p>
<p>If you did not expect this, you can ignore this email.</p>
